# Workers static assets rewrites
# (https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/).
# Cloudflare evaluates these before matching a file.
#
# out/404.html must exist under that name: not_found_handling = "404-page"
# (wrangler.jsonc) serves it, with status 404, for every path that matches no
# file. Requested by its own name, though, it is an ordinary file and would be
# served with status 200, a soft 404. Rewriting both of its names to a path
# that is never exported sends them through not_found_handling too, so they
# also get the 404 page with status 404. static-export.test.ts checks that the
# target is not exported.
/404       /404-page-not-exported  200
/404.html  /404-page-not-exported  200
